      "writtenOn": "2023-11-13T11:37:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is an extension for the case when the type byte from the Bluetooth defined LTV type reaches it\u0027s highest possible value. That\u0027s only possible at BT specification level where types are passed over the air as byte values. We are not limited by this, since here types are true and distinct parcelable types. I\u0027ll remove this parcelable. Thanks for asking.",
